  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">欢迎体验 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nature-x-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Nature X Plus</strong></a>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sX3Fgk205jE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">**************************************************************************************************</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/sDL7LRkH/Frame-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"599\" height=\"453\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">**************************************************************************************************</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Nature X 前置要求：</strong></span><strong>&nbsp; [点击图片前往模组官方下载页面]</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- Nature X 需要 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Sodium</span>：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/m2B9NJvs/sodium-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 您还需要安装 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Continuity</span> 和 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Polytone</span>！这需要使用 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric API</span><br></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/5NDVMWbZ/fabric-api-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cLYNxkJs/continuity-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cJSGr7Kr/Polytone-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>********************************************************************************************************</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意事项：请确保在 [Sodium] 中将以下设置调整为：<br></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>画质 > 树叶 > 精致</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>画质 > 粒子效果 > 全部</strong></li>\n<li><strong>画质 > 平滑光照 > 开启</strong></li>\n<li><strong>如果有任何与开启/关闭雾效相关的选项，请确保已启用。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>********************************************************************************************************</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>关注 Nature X：<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/u52899721\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wBQ8JtJ2/Patreon-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@huthaifa22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/G2XW7ZXg/You-Tube-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/gK6bR98P\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/yd6qTVy8/discord-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">********************************************************************************************************</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>图片展示：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/XJmGQL7j/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/qRL2cK4g/2024-09-25-23-20-43.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PqVDmPXL/2024-09-29-12-18-07.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/yd3ZVHsh/cherry.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/9QVMXLyv/2024-10-09-21-19-18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/N0SKCzmK/snowy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c68LVgt/2024-10-09-00-33-44.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/fWjbYL2t/sunflower.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/CxdLy4Fk/old-Growth-Pine-Taiga.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/rm28rX5N/swamp.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wM6gwXft/desert.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/SRDbLTcR/2024-11-03-11-58-43.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hPZc079j/coral.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/TPgxG7BL/lush-Caves.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/FRxQkfrh/mushroom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/fTyhkT6h/nether.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VNQy795Y/end.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"800\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">********************************************************</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-版权信息-</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-请勿在未授权的情况下重新发布我的作品，或盗用/使用其中的任何素材。<br>-我的作品官方下载渠道为 PMC、CurseForge、Modrinth 和 Patreon。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-由 hothaifah 制作-</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
